<h3><u>Arzu-e-karbala</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><b><u><font size=""4""><p>Arzu-e-karbala</p>
</font></u></b><p><font size=""4"">(Jaraha Hoon Jaraha Hoon) x2<br>
(Karbala) x4</font></p><font size=""4"">
<p>Jaraha Ho Karbala Main Jarha Hoon Karbala Main</p>
<ol><li>(Mominon Mil Kar Chalo) x2 Yeh Hai Hussaini Qafla</li><p>(Nauha Parhho Matam Karo) x2 (Hussain Ya Hussain) x2 (Jaraha Ho Karbala Main) x2</p><li>Farz Hai Ganj-e-Shahidan Ki Ziarat Is Tarha</li><p>Farz Quraan Ki Tilawat Aur Ibadat Jis Tarha</p><p>Karbalal Ghum Ka Madina Karbala Kaaba Numa</p><p>(Nauha Parhho Matam Karo) x2 (Hussain Ya Hussain) x2 (Jaraha Ho Karbala Main) x2</p><li>Woh Zamin Jo Mool Li Thi Syed-e-Abrar(a.s.) Nay</li><p>Us Zamin Par Sheh(a.s.) Ko Mara Shimr-e-Bad Atwar Nay</p><p>Us Zamin Ki Khaak Ko Sheh(a.s.) Nay Kia Khaak-e-Shifa</p><p>(Nauha Parhho Matam Karo) x2 (Hussain Ya Hussain) x2 (Jaraha Ho Karbala Main) x2</p><li>Karbala Kia Hai Moalla Adam(a.s.)-o-Eesa(a.s.) Ka Hai</li><p>Karbala Dar-Ul-Khilafa Khum Kay Us Mola(a.s.) Ka Hai</p><p>Jo Kay Hai Nafs-e-Payambar(s.a.w.w.) Jo Kay Hai Sher-e-Khuda(a.s.)</p><p>(Nauha Parhho Matam Karo) x2 (Hussain Ya Hussain) x2 (Jaraha Ho Karbala Main) x2</p><li>Yeh Zamin Woh Hai Jahan Sota Hai Zehra(s.a.) Ka Pisar</li><p>Ambia(a.s.) Kartay Hain Sajda Ab Bhi Us Ki Khaak Par</p><p>Apnay Bachchon Kay Liey Mehw-e-Fughaan Hain Syeda(s.a.)</p><p>(Nauha Parhho Matam Karo) x2 (Hussain Ya Hussain) x2 (Jaraha Ho Karbala Main) x2</p><li>Gardan-e-Shabbir(a.s.) Par Khanjar Chala Tha Jis Jagah</li><p>Seena-e-Akbar(a.s.) Mein Naiza Tha Jahan Toota Hua</p><p>Gulshan-e-Zehra(s.a.) Kay Gul Bootay Jahan Hain Ja Baja</p><p>(Nauha Parhho Matam Karo) x2 (Hussain Ya Hussain) x2 (Jaraha Ho Karbala Main) x2</p><li>Roza-e-Abbas(a.s.) Par Jakar Azadari Karein</li><p>Roza-e-Shabbir(a.s.) Par Aankhon Say Khoon Jaari Karein</p><p>Alqama Peh Jakay Piyason(a.s.) Ki Karein Majlis Bapa</p><p>(Nauha Parhho Matam Karo) x2 (Hussain Ya Hussain) x2 (Jaraha Ho Karbala Main) x2</p><li>Haaey Woh Shaam-e-Ghariban Jis Mein Zainab(s.a.) Lut Gai</li></ol>

<p>Baap Say Baali Sakina(s.a.) Beton(a.s.) Say Maan(s.a.) Chut Gai</p>
<p>Asghar(a.s.)-e-Maasoom Ka Jis Dasht Mein Jhoola Jala</p>
<p>(Nauha Parhho Matam Karo) x2 (Hussain Ya Hussain) x2 (Jaraha Ho Karbala Main) x2</p></font></p>
